[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://vehicles/vehicle_tune.gd" id="1_tune"]

; The CNG auto rickshaw, the driver's vehicle (P1-021): three wheels (one steered front, two driven rear), the stand-in
; kit body with the driver, the close chase camera. GAME.md "Movement and camera feel": top speed about 65 km/h, 0 to
; 40 km/h in 5 to 6 s, 60 to 0 in 18 to 22 m; a tight turn at low speed for a gali corner (full lock radius 3.5 to
; 4.5 m at 15 km/h) and no tip over on full lock at speed (the steer lock falls fast with speed). From the physics
; bench's first guess (game/bench/physics/tune.gd auto()), sized to the kit body. Mass with the driver.
